sty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹","author":"宋祁","text":"除地墙阴植翠筠，纤茎润叶与时新。\n赖逢醉日终无损，正似得全于酒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46567,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹","author":"宋祁","text":"新笋渐盈尺，新梢已铺瓦。\n燕雀忽相惊，深沈似隆夏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46568,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红蓼","author":"宋祁","text":"花穗迎秋结晚红，园林清淡更西风。\n纤条尽日差差影，时落钓璜溪水中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46569,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行客","author":"宋祁","text":"游子何方客，征裾满素尘。\n疲骖不进道，还犬复迎人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46570,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行药","author":"宋祁","text":"日烘霞底未成昏，拊物惊年并惨魂。\n李树已僵生意苦，秋虫何忍食桃根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46571,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行香","author":"宋祁","text":"朱华通奏见晨晖，内寺传薰得早归。\n私舍不应劳薄浣，天花仍在净名衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46572,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西斋新植萱草甚多作问答绝句二首 其一 问","author":"宋祁","text":"腻蘤金英扑，纤莛玉段抽。\n萱如解荣悴，争合自忘忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46573,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西斋新植萱草甚多作问答绝句二首 其二 答","author":"宋祁","text":"我有忘忧号，君为忧世人。\n欲忧忧底事，胡不暂怡神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46574,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖席上呈张学士","author":"宋祁","text":"野菊斑斑岸蓼红，使旗同驻赏秋风。\n斜阳更助凭栏胜，高下楼台波影中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46575,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西壁画松","author":"宋祁","text":"数株森立写皴坚，霜骨鳞肤千万年。\n秦帝从官徒自苦，取封不及大夫贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46576,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观书","author":"宋祁","text":"隐几穷千古，披经究万殊。\n扶疏曾答客，涉猎耻成儒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46577,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观邻人卖饼大售","author":"宋祁","text":"初日关门照上旌，芬肴无算客庖盈。\n本源渐大囊钱足，不复还家唱渭城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46578,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观舞","author":"宋祁","text":"蝶躞趁繁会，婆娑无定妍。\n心知吾地广，长袖得回旋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46579,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过玉莲汤","author":"宋祁","text":"平日宫中赐浴时，玉莲香目涌华漪。\n锦凫绣雁今安在，汩汩馀汤自入池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46580,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过淝口二首 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"氐丑矜凶甚，临流列万幢。\n由来不自项，何荷欲浮江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46581,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过淝口二首 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"淝水萦如带，淮山崒似云。\n此时闻鹤唳，无复畏官军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46582,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过摩诃池二首 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"池边不见帛阑船，麦陇连云树绕天。\n百岁兴衰已如此，争教东海不为田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46583,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过摩诃池二首 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"十顷隋家旧凿池，池平树尽但回堤。\n清尘满道君知否，半是当年浊水泥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46584,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]